%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: the default is stated at the first stroke.
% A page fills a rectangle and strokes thin lines at fractional
% positions without calling setstrokeadjust: the IR states the setting
% in effect (false) once, after the fill and before the first stroke, and
% the PDF selects an extended graphics state with /SA false there, so a
% renderer that adjusts strokes in a silent document draws them as asked.
0.5 setgray
72 600 200 100 rectfill
0 setgray
0.3 setlinewidth
72 500.4 moveto 400 500.4 lineto stroke
72 480.7 moveto 400 480.7 lineto stroke
showpage
